FerrionOS change to smoltcp (0BSD license, kept), made against the smoltcp 0.14.0 crate from crates.io (sha256 b6f8b28ad56c6e35524a37dd492af5d1a47e31e1a4d175cd12f89c075f01980f), for base's netstack; recipes/core/base/recipe.toml applies it:
- Interface::set_tcp_isn_generator: TCP sockets take the initial sequence number of each connection they open or accept from the given function of the connection's local and remote endpoints and the interface's time, instead of from the interface's random number generator.

